WEBVTT

00:14.590 --> 00:15.510
<b>This is it.</b>

00:29.570 --> 00:32.650
<b>Six Undead on par with Skeleton Knights?</b>

00:33.650 --> 00:34.490
<b>Fran.</b>

00:35.530 --> 00:37.660
<b>I'm going all out from the start!</b>

00:41.330 --> 00:43.290
<b>Leave this to me.</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:48.750
<b>Magic Wand, Hades's Blessing.</b>

00:52.300 --> 00:53.510
<b>Activate.</b>

00:56.640 --> 01:03.480
<b>Rest in peace, souls bound
by grudge and malice, beyond salvation.</b>

01:08.900 --> 01:10.360
<b>What terrible singing.</b>

01:11.400 --> 01:12.280
<b>Go!</b>

01:15.490 --> 01:16.320
<b>Jean!</b>

01:16.740 --> 01:18.700
<b>Take down the Dungeon Master.</b>

01:19.530 --> 01:22.080
<b>I've been saving this trump card
for this very moment.</b>

01:22.790 --> 01:23.910
<b>Hades.</b>

01:24.910 --> 01:26.500
<b>Grant him your blessing!</b>

01:39.300 --> 01:40.680
<b>Hey, seriously?</b>

01:42.260 --> 01:44.180
<b>He did that in a single blow?</b>

01:44.430 --> 01:46.100
<b>What incredible power.</b>

01:47.520 --> 01:50.310
<b>It's a wand that can purify the Undead
over a massive area</b>

01:50.400 --> 01:52.400
<b>and send them to the afterlife.</b>

01:52.900 --> 01:53.940
<b>Amazing.</b>

01:58.280 --> 01:59.990
<b>How magnificent.</b>

02:00.240 --> 02:03.790
<b>To think my high-ranking subordinates
were wiped out in an instant.</b>

02:04.700 --> 02:06.710
<b>That was an impressive move.</b>

02:07.040 --> 02:08.040
<b>What?</b>

02:28.460 --> 02:30.750
<b>Reincarnated as a Sword Season 2</b>

03:41.590 --> 03:42.760
<b>How…</b>

03:43.090 --> 03:45.760
<b>How are you still standing
despite being Undead?</b>

03:48.020 --> 03:52.020
<b>That seemed to be a trump card
used at the cost of your life force.</b>

03:52.100 --> 03:54.060
<b>But it's useless against me.</b>

03:54.230 --> 03:55.650
<b>That's impossible.</b>

03:55.940 --> 03:56.770
<b>- Jean!
- Jean!</b>

03:58.250 --> 04:02.760
<b>Episode 4:
The King of the Undead Falls into Despair</b>

03:58.400 --> 04:01.400
<b>Your life force is nearly depleted.</b>

04:01.490 --> 04:02.900
<b>It's no surprise considering how many Undead</b>

04:02.900 --> 04:04.320
<b>It's no surprise considering how many Undead</b>

04:04.410 --> 04:06.120
<b>you just purged.</b>

04:06.660 --> 04:08.200
<b>Jean, you need to rest.</b>

04:08.290 --> 04:09.700
<b>Greater Heal.</b>

04:11.710 --> 04:15.330
<b>It's not an injury, so healing won't work.</b>

04:16.340 --> 04:19.800
<b>Then at least drink a Stamina Potion.</b>

04:19.880 --> 04:21.090
<b>Sorry.</b>

04:21.470 --> 04:22.720
<b>That guy</b>

04:22.800 --> 04:26.050
<b>is completely unscathed
after such a powerful purification?</b>

04:26.260 --> 04:28.060
<b>If purification doesn't work,</b>

04:29.430 --> 04:30.680
<b>then I'll just cut him down.</b>

04:34.690 --> 04:35.690
<b>Through!</b>

04:38.480 --> 04:40.110
<b>The sword passed right through him.</b>

04:40.190 --> 04:41.690
<b>What on earth is he?</b>

04:43.700 --> 04:44.820
<b>Fire Arrow!</b>

04:49.490 --> 04:50.830
<b>No physical form?</b>

04:55.250 --> 04:56.210
<b>Is he an illusion?</b>

04:56.290 --> 04:57.420
<b>Not yet!</b>

05:07.550 --> 05:09.510
<b>Everything just passed right through him.</b>

05:10.100 --> 05:11.180
<b>Don't talk, Fran.</b>

05:13.020 --> 05:15.560
<b>Did you think close combat
would actually work?</b>

05:15.850 --> 05:18.730
<b>He cut her life force in half
with a single blow?</b>

05:18.810 --> 05:19.940
<b>Greater Heal!</b>

05:20.820 --> 05:22.610
<b>If he can deal physical damage,</b>

05:22.690 --> 05:25.530
<b>that means he's not just an illusion.</b>

05:26.110 --> 05:28.870
<b>An elemental sword should work
on spiritual bodies too.</b>

05:29.240 --> 05:31.160
<b>But it still went right through him.</b>

05:31.740 --> 05:33.750
<b>Is this some kind of skill?</b>

05:34.160 --> 05:37.000
<b>Jean, do you know what's going on?</b>

05:37.580 --> 05:41.550
<b>Sorry. Soul Eye doesn't work on the Undead.</b>

05:42.090 --> 05:43.960
<b>My Appraisal is useless too.</b>

05:44.340 --> 05:45.920
<b>Damn it. What do we do?</b>

05:48.260 --> 05:49.180
<b>Teacher.</b>

05:50.760 --> 05:52.760
<b>Can you buy me some time?</b>

05:53.180 --> 05:55.100
<b>Do you have a plan?</b>

05:55.430 --> 05:56.810
<b>I'm not sure yet.</b>

05:57.480 --> 05:58.770
<b>But please trust me.</b>

05:59.770 --> 06:00.690
<b>Leave it to us.</b>

06:00.900 --> 06:02.150
<b>All right, Fran.</b>

06:02.230 --> 06:05.150
<b>Move without letting him notice.</b>

06:05.240 --> 06:07.700
<b>Be careful.
It might counterattack like that again.</b>

06:07.780 --> 06:08.610
<b>Understood.</b>

06:08.700 --> 06:11.910
<b>Overspec Undead Summoning!</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:16.870
<b>For the sake of my long-held ambition,</b>

06:16.960 --> 06:22.340
<b>let me see if you're worthy of
becoming my immortal pawns.</b>

06:24.000 --> 06:25.800
<b>Urushi, protect Jean.</b>

06:27.260 --> 06:29.300
<b>Now, come at me.</b>

06:29.890 --> 06:30.720
<b>Fran.</b>

06:31.680 --> 06:32.720
<b>Here I go.</b>

06:50.860 --> 06:54.120
<b>Are these Undead
even weaker than the last ones?</b>

06:56.540 --> 07:00.040
<b>He's trying to crush our spirits
with sheer numbers.</b>

07:02.250 --> 07:03.920
<b>He's so calm.</b>

07:04.290 --> 07:05.460
<b>That's part of it,</b>

07:06.210 --> 07:09.760
<b>but he likely wants to use us
as materials for his Undead.</b>

07:10.090 --> 07:14.140
<b>So he's holding back
to keep the corpses intact?</b>

07:15.390 --> 07:19.690
<b>After all, each of you
looks like excellent material.</b>

07:24.360 --> 07:25.650
<b>What's the matter?</b>

07:25.730 --> 07:28.070
<b>Your movements are getting sluggish.</b>

07:28.570 --> 07:30.530
<b>Are you already at your limit?</b>

07:42.460 --> 07:44.840
<b>We've been fighting for an hour.</b>

07:45.250 --> 07:47.050
<b>Jean, aren't you ready yet?</b>

08:02.310 --> 08:03.270
<b>It's useless.</b>

08:03.650 --> 08:05.230
<b>It's completely useless.</b>

08:13.740 --> 08:14.740
<b>How can this be?</b>

08:14.990 --> 08:16.530
<b>Fran, don't let your guard down.</b>

08:22.540 --> 08:23.870
<b>Got you.</b>

08:23.960 --> 08:24.790
<b>Fran!</b>

08:27.840 --> 08:29.170
<b>Fran!</b>

08:30.630 --> 08:34.340
<b>Gosh, I used too much strength
without thinking.</b>

08:34.800 --> 08:38.350
<b>You bastard. How dare you hit Fran's face!</b>

08:39.470 --> 08:41.680
<b>Heal her properly.</b>

08:42.350 --> 08:43.850
<b>It's not over yet.</b>

08:45.690 --> 08:47.730
<b>Are you still holding out hope?</b>

08:48.400 --> 08:50.650
<b>But when that hope is turned upside down,</b>

08:50.940 --> 08:54.360
<b>I can't wait to see the look on your face.</b>

08:57.370 --> 08:59.330
<b>Damn it. That bastard.</b>

08:59.410 --> 09:01.500
<b>He's totally enjoying this.</b>

09:02.750 --> 09:04.670
<b>Even so, if he goes all out now,</b>

09:04.750 --> 09:07.460
<b>we'll lose without even landing a hit.</b>

09:08.250 --> 09:11.000
<b>We can't win unless we solve his mystery.</b>

09:12.210 --> 09:13.880
<b>What's wrong?</b>

09:13.970 --> 09:17.300
<b>My summoning magic is almost complete.</b>

09:18.100 --> 09:21.770
<b>Overlord, Undead Summoning!</b>

09:23.770 --> 09:25.600
<b>Another High Undead.</b>

09:27.600 --> 09:29.900
<b>Is his mana bottomless?</b>

09:30.400 --> 09:31.360
<b>Not bad.</b>

09:31.820 --> 09:33.150
<b>That's the look.</b>

09:33.240 --> 09:36.320
<b>The look of hope stained with despair.</b>

09:59.090 --> 10:00.100
<b>Fran!</b>

10:02.060 --> 10:03.060
<b>It's happening.</b>

10:07.350 --> 10:08.310
<b>What's going on?</b>

10:08.400 --> 10:09.860
<b>What's this vibration?</b>

10:10.110 --> 10:12.110
<b>Looks like it worked.</b>

10:12.770 --> 10:14.230
<b>Did you do this?</b>

10:14.320 --> 10:15.530
<b>It wasn't me.</b>

10:18.030 --> 10:19.530
<b>What?</b>

10:21.530 --> 10:24.120
<b>He's panicking! Now is our chance!</b>

10:26.750 --> 10:28.710
<b>Could this feeling be…</b>

10:28.790 --> 10:30.580
<b>Impossible!</b>

10:31.080 --> 10:33.300
<b>It was my subordinate.</b>

10:34.300 --> 10:36.920
<b>Stefan destroyed the Grudge Reactor.</b>

10:38.800 --> 10:40.010
<b>Stefan!</b>

10:40.090 --> 10:41.550
<b>Grudge Reactor?</b>

10:41.850 --> 10:47.180
<b>A device that converts
the grudges in this dungeon into mana.</b>

10:47.640 --> 10:50.560
<b>That's the source of his infinite mana.</b>

10:51.060 --> 10:52.190
<b>In other words…</b>

10:52.560 --> 10:55.320
<b>The mana supply from the dungeon
has been cut off!</b>

10:58.240 --> 11:01.110
<b>The Grudge Reactor's mana is disappearing.</b>

11:01.200 --> 11:03.370
<b>I've spent years building it up.</b>

11:03.450 --> 11:08.870
<b>It's the key to defeating
that wretched kingdom!</b>

11:09.370 --> 11:12.170
<b>Did he say revenge on the kingdom?</b>

11:13.000 --> 11:14.500
<b>This is unforgivable.</b>

11:15.420 --> 11:16.880
<b>- I'll never
- I'll never</b>

11:17.340 --> 11:20.090
<b>- forgive you!
- forgive you!</b>

11:22.260 --> 11:23.760
<b>What powerful mana.</b>

11:23.850 --> 11:25.310
<b>Hey.</b>

11:25.390 --> 11:27.430
<b>Shouldn't he be getting weaker?</b>

11:27.720 --> 11:30.270
<b>No, he just has limits now.</b>

11:30.640 --> 11:34.020
<b>The fundamental gap in mana
hasn't been bridged yet.</b>

11:34.440 --> 11:36.900
<b>Is this his true power?</b>

11:37.570 --> 11:40.950
<b>I will no longer turn you into minions.</b>

11:41.030 --> 11:43.570
<b>I'll make you regret
ever being born into this world.</b>

11:43.660 --> 11:45.780
<b>And then I'll torture you to death.</b>

11:46.200 --> 11:50.160
<b>Don't think you'll find peace in death!</b>

11:51.210 --> 11:52.710
<b>Panic Skill?</b>

11:58.960 --> 12:00.420
<b>Skeleton Cloak…</b>

12:01.550 --> 12:03.050
<b>I'm not afraid of</b>

12:03.640 --> 12:04.890
<b>someone like you!</b>

12:05.800 --> 12:07.720
<b>What's with that look?</b>

12:08.100 --> 12:13.650
<b>Do you still harbor the naive thought
that you can defeat me?</b>

12:14.610 --> 12:16.270
<b>In that case, I shall show you.</b>

12:16.360 --> 12:18.820
<b>Deactivating Camouflage Appraisal.</b>

12:19.230 --> 12:20.360
<b>Appraisal?</b>

12:21.840 --> 12:27.010
<b>Lich</b>

12:21.840 --> 12:27.010
<b>Race: Magic Beast, Undead
Status: Archwraith</b>

12:21.840 --> 12:30.890
<b>HP:  4863
Mana:   7467
Strength:  934
Agility:  666</b>

12:22.150 --> 12:24.320
<b>What is this?</b>

12:24.410 --> 12:26.580
<b>He's on a whole different level.</b>

12:26.640 --> 12:30.890
<b>Skills: Chant Shortening 10,
Wind Magic 7
Space-Time Magic 7</b>

12:26.640 --> 12:30.890
<b>Special Skill: Resentment Absorption,
Resentment Conversion, Camouflage Appraisal
Extra Skill: Principle of Impurity 8
Titles: Great Sinner, Dungeon Master, Avenger
Equipment: Robe of Grudge</b>

12:26.660 --> 12:28.450
<b>If he'd been going all out,</b>

12:28.540 --> 12:30.910
<b>he'd have killed us instantly.</b>

12:31.250 --> 12:33.670
<b>Fran, don't let your guard down
for even a second.</b>

12:38.750 --> 12:42.590
<b>Does my true power fill you with despair?</b>

12:42.670 --> 12:45.180
<b>Your face is full of it.</b>

12:45.760 --> 12:48.720
<b>Overlord, Undead Summoning.</b>

13:01.650 --> 13:02.530
<b>Fran!</b>

13:14.040 --> 13:16.040
<b>Suffer even more!</b>

13:17.460 --> 13:18.340
<b>Fran!</b>

13:19.630 --> 13:20.710
<b>Be crushed!</b>

13:20.800 --> 13:25.220
<b>Earth Magic, Gravity Press!</b>

13:28.890 --> 13:29.970
<b>Fran!</b>

13:32.350 --> 13:34.310
<b>You destroyed the Grudge Reactor.</b>

13:34.560 --> 13:37.020
<b>How could I let you die so easily?</b>

13:41.110 --> 13:42.400
<b>I'll save you for last.</b>

13:42.690 --> 13:44.860
<b>Stand there and wait for me.</b>

13:46.990 --> 13:48.280
<b>Suffer!</b>

13:51.700 --> 13:52.580
<b>Damn it.</b>

13:52.660 --> 13:53.910
<b>Teacher…</b>

13:54.000 --> 13:55.120
<b>Powerless.</b>

13:55.210 --> 13:56.920
<b>Overwhelmingly powerless.</b>

13:57.330 --> 14:00.420
<b>Curse your own powerlessness.</b>

14:00.880 --> 14:03.710
<b>Repent for your heinous sins</b>

14:03.800 --> 14:06.470
<b>as you are crushed to death!</b>

14:15.890 --> 14:17.140
<b>Urushi.</b>

14:17.940 --> 14:19.060
<b>Jean.</b>

14:20.060 --> 14:21.320
<b>Fran.</b>

14:22.230 --> 14:24.530
<b>I'm sorry. I…</b>

14:27.280 --> 14:31.530
<b>I want to put an end
to the oppression of the Black Cat Tribe.</b>

14:32.200 --> 14:34.950
<b>No one in the tribe evolves.</b>

14:35.040 --> 14:37.410
<b>That's why I want to evolve.</b>

14:38.170 --> 14:41.500
<b>Teacher, you're a super strong sword!</b>

14:44.090 --> 14:45.460
<b>That's right.</b>

14:45.760 --> 14:48.930
<b>I can't die here before she evolves.</b>

14:50.840 --> 14:53.430
<b>I won't let you lift another finger.</b>

14:53.850 --> 14:55.270
<b>But that's not enough.</b>

14:55.890 --> 14:57.310
<b>My minions.</b>

14:57.390 --> 14:59.480
<b>Tear off their limbs</b>

14:59.560 --> 15:00.850
<b>and skin them alive!</b>

15:00.940 --> 15:04.400
<b>Crush their bones and scatter them
all over the ground!</b>

15:05.070 --> 15:07.610
<b>Jean, are you still alive?</b>

15:08.400 --> 15:10.910
<b>I'm barely hanging on.</b>

15:11.370 --> 15:12.620
<b>I have a plan.</b>

15:12.870 --> 15:16.080
<b>Let's land a blow
on that arrogant bastard.</b>

15:19.330 --> 15:20.330
<b>Can you do it?</b>

15:20.750 --> 15:22.080
<b>Do you even have to ask?</b>

15:22.580 --> 15:24.090
<b>Don't you die on me.</b>

15:26.260 --> 15:29.510
<b>My minions, come to my side.</b>

15:31.640 --> 15:33.600
<b>What is it, Necromancer?</b>

15:34.350 --> 15:36.600
<b>What's with that look in your eyes?</b>

15:36.810 --> 15:38.810
<b>High Undead Summoning!</b>

15:39.020 --> 15:40.810
<b>Come forth, Stefan!</b>

15:45.730 --> 15:47.820
<b>An Undead Devourer?</b>

15:47.900 --> 15:48.820
<b>Master.</b>

15:49.190 --> 15:51.320
<b>Well done, Stefan.</b>

15:51.700 --> 15:52.610
<b>Yes.</b>

15:53.070 --> 15:55.160
<b>How did you…</b>

15:56.910 --> 15:58.000
<b>Master.</b>

15:58.580 --> 16:00.500
<b>Fran, I'm glad you held out.</b>

16:00.580 --> 16:02.710
<b>You and Urushi too.</b>

16:04.380 --> 16:07.750
<b>My current master is Lord Jean Du Vix.</b>

16:09.970 --> 16:14.760
<b>My necromancy isn't just for show.</b>

16:15.140 --> 16:18.770
<b>I never thought one of my minions
would be stolen from me.</b>

16:19.270 --> 16:20.350
<b>Master…</b>

16:20.890 --> 16:22.350
<b>We haven't lost yet.</b>

16:23.230 --> 16:25.230
<b>Nothing will change.</b>

16:25.310 --> 16:28.190
<b>Even with one more Undead Devourer,
it's the same.</b>

16:32.490 --> 16:34.620
<b>Where did your despair go?</b>

16:36.830 --> 16:38.870
<b>What is despair?</b>

16:39.660 --> 16:42.080
<b>Fran is very strong!</b>

16:48.800 --> 16:50.510
<b>Stefan, thank you.</b>

16:50.840 --> 16:51.970
<b>Ms. Fran.</b>

16:52.300 --> 16:54.890
<b>I'm so glad I teamed up with you.</b>

16:58.310 --> 17:01.930
<b>I'm glad I teamed up with everyone too.</b>

17:06.940 --> 17:08.360
<b>You lot…</b>

17:08.730 --> 17:10.730
<b>What are you laughing at?</b>

17:11.190 --> 17:13.570
<b>Fran, can you follow the plan?</b>

17:14.490 --> 17:15.490
<b>No problem.</b>

17:16.240 --> 17:18.950
<b>Hades's Blessing, activate.</b>

17:19.280 --> 17:20.870
<b>That wand again?</b>

17:20.950 --> 17:22.700
<b>It's useless against me.</b>

17:22.790 --> 17:24.410
<b>Bound by resentment and grudges…</b>

17:24.500 --> 17:25.830
<b>Stefan.</b>

17:25.920 --> 17:28.250
<b>Get behind me before the incantation ends.</b>

17:28.670 --> 17:29.590
<b>Master.</b>

17:31.840 --> 17:33.760
<b>Now, I shall put a stop to this.</b>

17:41.270 --> 17:44.060
<b>Amplify Mana Barrier!</b>

17:46.480 --> 17:47.480
<b>Master.</b>

17:47.900 --> 17:50.020
<b>I'll protect you until it activates.</b>

17:52.650 --> 17:56.610
<b>Rest in peace, lost souls.</b>

18:00.990 --> 18:02.450
<b>A futile effort.</b>

18:02.950 --> 18:04.000
<b>Hades.</b>

18:04.370 --> 18:06.120
<b>Grant him your blessing!</b>

18:08.580 --> 18:10.130
<b>I won't let you escape again.</b>

18:10.340 --> 18:12.090
<b>Skill Taker!</b>

18:14.460 --> 18:15.550
<b>What?</b>

18:16.590 --> 18:18.140
<b>Using Skill Taker,</b>

18:18.220 --> 18:20.800
<b>I've stolen Space-Time Magic 7.</b>

18:25.390 --> 18:27.520
<b>What's going on?</b>

18:27.830 --> 18:29.080
<b>Lich</b>

18:27.830 --> 18:29.080
<b>Race: Magic Beast, Undead
Status: Archwraith</b>

18:27.830 --> 18:30.790
<b>HP:  4863
Mana:   7467
Strength:  934
Agility:  666</b>

18:28.560 --> 18:29.730
<b>Space-Time Magic,</b>

18:28.670 --> 18:30.790
<b>Skills: Chant Shortening 10,
Wind Magic 7
Space-Time Magic 7</b>

18:28.670 --> 18:30.790
<b>Special Skill: Resentment Absorption,
Resentment Conversion, Camouflage Appraisal
Extra Skill: Principle of Impurity 8
Titles: Great Sinner, Dungeon Master, Avenger
Equipment: Robe of Grudge</b>

18:29.810 --> 18:31.650
<b>Dimensional Shift.</b>

18:30.790 --> 18:32.290
<b>Space-Time Magic 7</b>

18:31.730 --> 18:33.690
<b>It allows one to shift dimensions</b>

18:32.290 --> 18:33.800
<b>Nullify Seal</b>

18:33.780 --> 18:36.530
<b>for a split second to evade attacks.</b>

18:37.400 --> 18:39.820
<b>In this space
where teleportation is sealed,</b>

18:40.320 --> 18:44.660
<b>only he could do it
because of his Nullify Seal skill.</b>

18:45.200 --> 18:47.620
<b>But now that
your Space-Time Magic is gone,</b>

18:47.920 --> 18:49.370
<b>you can no longer shift!</b>

18:49.750 --> 18:52.340
<b>Take everything we've got!</b>

18:57.380 --> 19:00.800
<b>The light is eroding me.</b>

19:01.510 --> 19:02.510
<b>This is impossible.</b>

19:02.890 --> 19:04.140
<b>I'm fading away.</b>

19:04.220 --> 19:07.350
<b>To vanish before my revenge is complete…</b>

19:07.810 --> 19:10.650
<b>How could I…</b>

19:18.280 --> 19:19.200
<b>Master.</b>

19:23.740 --> 19:24.740
<b>It's not over yet!</b>

19:25.620 --> 19:26.580
<b>What?</b>

19:29.870 --> 19:32.170
<b>No way. He survived that?</b>

19:36.300 --> 19:37.210
<b>Screams?</b>

19:37.300 --> 19:39.010
<b>What is this?</b>

19:39.800 --> 19:41.970
<b>Is this resentment?</b>

19:42.890 --> 19:43.890
<b>Master.</b>

19:45.140 --> 19:49.230
<b>The Dungeon Master is absorbing
the resentment of the entire dungeon.</b>

19:49.310 --> 19:50.140
<b>What?</b>

19:50.230 --> 19:52.770
<b>His Principle of Impurity</b>

19:52.860 --> 19:55.020
<b>is a skill that lets him absorb
resentment from other Undead</b>

19:55.110 --> 19:57.440
<b>and turn it into his own power.</b>

19:57.860 --> 19:59.570
<b>Released from Grudge Reactor,</b>

19:59.650 --> 20:01.950
<b>a massive surge of resentment
with nowhere to go</b>

20:02.030 --> 20:04.030
<b>is flowing into the Dungeon Master's body.</b>

20:04.780 --> 20:07.490
<b>But it doesn't look like he's recovering.</b>

20:08.000 --> 20:11.000
<b>Tens of thousands of resentments
he can't handle</b>

20:11.080 --> 20:12.830
<b>are rushing into him.</b>

20:15.380 --> 20:17.920
<b>The resentment is so dense
it's materializing.</b>

20:18.260 --> 20:21.880
<b>At this rate, we'll all be swallowed
by the murky torrent of resentment!</b>

20:25.760 --> 20:27.850
<b>I'll do my best to protect Jean,</b>

20:28.270 --> 20:30.020
<b>but I can't help you two.</b>

20:34.350 --> 20:35.770
<b>Mana Barrier!</b>

20:35.980 --> 20:36.980
<b>Fran!</b>

20:37.520 --> 20:39.690
<b>We'll put up
a full-scale Mana Barrier too!</b>

20:39.780 --> 20:41.150
<b>I'll add mine to it!</b>

20:41.860 --> 20:43.160
<b>Urushi, hide in the shadows!</b>

20:46.780 --> 20:49.080
<b>Everyone, please stay safe!</b>

20:50.580 --> 20:53.000
<b>Purification magic plus a barrier…</b>

20:56.790 --> 20:59.380
<b>Even through the barrier,
the impact is still so strong.</b>

21:00.340 --> 21:02.510
<b>We just have to hold out
until it subsides.</b>

21:03.510 --> 21:05.890
<b>But will it ever subside?</b>

21:08.260 --> 21:09.810
<b>Don't lose heart!</b>

21:10.270 --> 21:12.770
<b>Fran, we have to make it back alive.</b>

21:13.850 --> 21:16.860
<b>I want to eat curry with Urushi, Jean,</b>

21:17.730 --> 21:19.900
<b>and Stefan!</b>

21:21.650 --> 21:23.320
<b>Find the exit.</b>

21:26.780 --> 21:28.410
<b>The resentment is gone?</b>

21:33.160 --> 21:34.040
<b>Fran!</b>

21:34.920 --> 21:37.170
<b>The resentment is coming after us.</b>

21:37.540 --> 21:39.040
<b>Shape-Shift!</b>

21:42.630 --> 21:43.970
<b>Teacher.</b>

21:44.760 --> 21:47.680
<b>Damn it. This is bad.</b>

21:48.010 --> 21:51.390
<b>No, there must be a way.</b>

21:52.640 --> 21:53.980
<b>Think.</b>

21:54.060 --> 21:55.270
<b>Find it!</b>

21:57.190 --> 21:58.860
<b>This skill…</b>

21:59.270 --> 22:00.940
<b>I'll have to bet everything on this.</b>

23:33.970 --> 23:39.960
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:33.970 --> 23:39.960
<b>Bid Farewell with a Smile</b>
